versoes.objetivos:
-Apresentar conceitos relacionados à termodinâmica, mecânica dos fluidos e transferência de calor aplicados à situações de interesse no campo de engenharia elétrica;
-Incentivar a autocrítica, a ética profissional e o bom senso na prática da Engenharia.

Goals - To present concepts related to the Thermodynamics, Mechanics of the Fluids and Heat Transfer applied to situations of interest in the field of the Electric Engineering; to motivate the self-criticism, the professional ethics and the common sense in practice of the Engineering..
